00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:50.643
You know what? He came to me
like, "What about Karol G Now?"

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:53.145
And I was like, "Why 'Now'?"

00:01:53.145 --> 00:01:55.114
-Oh, Karol G Now,
part of the name?

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:57.049
-Like -- Yeah, like the Now,

00:01:57.049 --> 00:02:00.586
