like Karol G New Era.

00:02:00.586 --> 00:02:04.190
And I was like, "Uh, no."

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:07.026
I don't like it at all.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:09.228
-Karol G Now,
that's very interesting.

00:02:09.228 --> 00:02:12.731
Did you ever perform
under Karol G Now?

00:02:12.731 --> 00:02:14.534
-Yeah, like about a year.

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:15.635
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:17.537
I can tell you're excited
about it. Yeah.

00:02:17.537 --> 00:02:19.139
-No, that's so embarrassing.

00:02:19.139 --> 00:02:21.841
-You grew up in Colombia.
And is this true?

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:24.677
