-Like a super fan.

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:28.480
Oh, my God. Like, they were --

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:32.418
Like, yeah.
In Colombia, we knew them a lot.

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:34.954
It was because my family
and my family's mother

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:36.422
