tapes and VHS about them.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:43.695
And I was, like,
so in love with Nick,

00:02:43.695 --> 00:02:45.898
the blond one, the blond one.
[ Audience cheering ]

00:02:45.898 --> 00:02:48.667
-Yeah, you guys --
Yeah, Nick is very -- Yeah.

00:02:48.667 --> 00:02:50.469
He's a very --
-He was so hot!

00:02:50.469 --> 00:02:53.305
-Yeah, he is.
Yeah, he's a good-looking dude.

00:02:53.305 --> 00:02:56.341
Do they know
that Karol G is a huge fan?

00:02:56.341 --> 00:02:59.045
-I don't know. But, hey,
you know what, Backstreet Boys?

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:01.214
Karol G is a huge fan of you.

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:03.382
