00:03:12.758 --> 00:03:14.760
Everyone can get this tomorrow.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:15.795
-Tomorrow.
-Yeah.

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:17.396
-My God. Yeah!

00:03:17.396 --> 00:03:19.732
