I'm dying.

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:21.800
-No, no, no, no,
no, no, no, no, no!

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:23.937
I have to ask you --
I have questions.

00:03:23.937 --> 00:03:25.270
You make the record, right?

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:27.073
