00:03:35.247 --> 00:03:36.915
-That cover -- [ Laughs ]

00:03:36.915 --> 00:03:39.919
It's a cover of my dream.

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:41.087
-Yeah.
-You know what?

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:43.322
Like, I just wanted
to express in a cover,

00:03:43.322 --> 00:03:46.225
