coming on to perform.

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:07.239
I'm like, "Will she talk to me?"
'Cause I just --

00:05:07.239 --> 00:05:09.975
I mean, how charming is Karol G?
I mean, God.

00:05:09.975 --> 00:05:13.145
How -- Just perfect.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:13.145 --> 00:05:14.446
I love you.
I love you right back.

00:05:14.446 --> 00:05:15.681
